  "synthesis": "Activity around protein binder design now spans research records, a code release, and a workflow announcement. The published analysis and its linked preprint describe the same work, so they contribute one published signal. An independent replication preprint adds a separate evaluation perspective, while the toolkit supplies shared inputs for comparison. The announcement describes a reference workflow using that evaluation protocol. Together these records motivate attention to reproducibility across implementations. They do not establish superiority on every dataset or demonstrate clinical performance; those conclusions would require evidence beyond the synthetic records included here.",
